WEBVTT


00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.260
You can now run your entire Shopify store directly inside of Claude

00:00:04.261 --> 00:00:06.741
using Shopify's official AI toolkit.

00:00:06.742 --> 00:00:09.261
This was released by the president of Shopify,

00:00:09.262 --> 00:00:11.261
Harley Finkelstein, just a week ago.

00:00:11.262 --> 00:00:12.501
And it's kind of a big deal.

00:00:12.502 --> 00:00:15.661
This allows you to use the toolkit to connect right into Claude

00:00:15.662 --> 00:00:17.761
and all of its AI capabilities.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:21.280
And unless you've been living under a rock for the last few months,

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.420
Claude is a whole AI ecosystem.

00:00:23.421 --> 00:00:25.781
It's not just a chatbot. It can think for you,

00:00:25.782 --> 00:00:27.221
it can create things for you,

00:00:27.222 --> 00:00:29.221
and it can even do tasks for you.

00:00:29.222 --> 00:00:31.121
So if you plug those things together,

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.620
it can run your entire Shopify store.

00:00:33.621 --> 00:00:35.341
And that's exactly what I've done.

00:00:35.342 --> 00:00:36.141
So in this video,

00:00:36.142 --> 00:00:39.701
I'm gonna show you the simplest and easiest way to set up Claude

00:00:39.702 --> 00:00:41.421
and the Shopify AI toolkit.

00:00:41.422 --> 00:00:44.461
And I'm gonna give you three use cases that you can be using right now

00:00:44.462 --> 00:00:46.681
to grow your store. Let's go.
